    {
      "name": "6. External API (SEC EDGAR)",
      "description": "The third-party integration from Part 1. These two requests reach data.sec.gov, so they are the only ones in the collection that need the network and the only ones that take seconds rather than milliseconds.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "collect Apple's figures",
